<!--
  WEEPINGSTONES_RM_MOD_BUILD_1, wave 2 — the canyon-filling crab.

  Owner ruling, NIGHTSIDE_ICE_DESIGN_SITTING_1, 2026-09-24, verbatim:
  "Summit crab should be adapted into the weeping stones as a whole canyon
  filling crab" — landform-scale, evicted from nightside_ice the same
  sitting. Per Q11a the identity is INVENTED (the donor's body/stats are
  the reference point, not its name or its franchise), so this ships RM_
  tier, no donor dependency. Name is a fresh coinage, collision-checked
  clean against design/ and src/ 2026-09-24 (`gorrask`: 0 hits) — evokes
  "gorge" + rock, in the Weeping Stones' harsh-consonant register (sillik/
  mirrik/ssurr/tirbak/burrak/vhakk/vellak/kirruk).

  Adapted FROM (reference only, not reused): AA_SummitCrab (Alpha Animals,
  Data/ThingDefs_Races/Races_BoulderMit.xml) — baseBodySize 15,
  baseHealthScale 4, ArmorRating_Blunt/Sharp 1.5, TurtleLike body,
  untameable, "entire mountains for a home." This def keeps the scale and
  armor register but drops the donor's VEF.AnimalBehaviours.Compproperties_
  Untameable comp (a Vanilla Expanded Framework dependency this RM_ mod may
  not assume) in favor of plain high Wildness + None trainability, which
  reads the same in play without a new hard dependency.

  🔴 v1 SCOPE NOTE (matches the roster JSON's own mechanic_load note): "fills
  a whole canyon" as a literal multi-tile landform body is NOT built here —
  that is a new placement mechanic (a hand-authored landmark occupying many
  map cells, closer to the Oasis landmark architecture than to an ordinary
  wildAnimals roll) and is not owed this wave. v1 ships Gorrask as a real,
  huge, legendary-rare single-tile creature (drawSize 5, matching the donor)
  so the def loads, tests and is huntable/tamable-checkable now; true
  landform-scale occupation is a follow-on mechanics item, not silently
  dropped.

  Placeholder art: reuses vanilla Tortoise body/texture retinted huge, same
  precedent as RM_StockedPoolFauna.xml's beast rows. Real art job filed
  this wave (infrastructure/artpipe/pending/weepingstones2_gorrask_{south,
  east,north}.json) after a done/_artsrc/registry sweep found nothing
  existing for "gorrask" 2026-09-24.
-->
<Defs>

